    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person realistic underwater explorer. Plunge into the real world horror of the ocean's dark depths. As you head down into the trench, the dark of the abyss surrounds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark of the Depths uses realistic visuals to put you in the pitch-black atmosphere of the deepest oceans. Use your torch to guide you through the darkness, avoiding violent fish and experience our fears of what lies beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter creatures such as Basking sharks and Killer whales. However, larger, more ferocious beasts lurk within the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Traverse a network of rusted oil structures in search of missing items. Recover interactive collectibles from wreckages and find all the items needed to complete the game and leave the ocean floor.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person realistic underwater explorer. Plunge into the real world horror of the ocean's dark depths. As you head down into the trench, the dark of the abyss surrounds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark of the Depths uses realistic visuals to put you in the pitch-black atmosphere of the deepest oceans. Use your torch to guide you through the darkness, avoiding violent fish and experience our fears of what lies beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter creatures such as Basking sharks and Killer whales. However, larger, more ferocious beasts lurk within the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Traverse a network of rusted oil structures in search of missing items. Recover interactive collectibles from wreckages and find all the items needed to complete the game and leave the ocean floor.</p>",
    "short_description": "A first-person deep-sea exploration game. Use only a torch to navigate through wrecks and rusted structures, encountering both dangerous and harmless sea creatures. Uncover the mysteries of the trench, find interactive collectibles, and experience the phobia-inducing atmosphere of the ocean floor.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
